{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]谢谢你们，谢谢你们啊……[r]哎哟！别生气了，之后让你吃上好的干草吃个饱。[l][cm]","charaName":"牧人拉尔特"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哞——！[l][cm]","charaName":"牛"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哎哟喂！别顶我的屁股了，好疼的！[r]谢谢你们挽回了我家牛牛的名誉，契约者们。这些是报酬。[l][cm]","charaName":"牧人拉尔特"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哎呦好疼！好了好了，这就开饭，不要再生气了！[l][cm]","charaName":"牧人拉尔特"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"wt_yz_10_1_y","des":"散落的谷物与我的牛_有材料"}